    "sections": {
        "description": "Driftor is a modern and flexible Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed for transport, logistics, cargo, freight, trucking companies, shipping services, and delivery businesses. Built with the latest WordPress block editor and full-site editing features, Driftor allows users to create professional logistics and transportation websites without any coding knowledge. The theme is lightweight, responsive, and optimized for performance, making it ideal for companies that want a fast, reliable, and visually appealing online presence."
